OL,5,     GOn 31 December 1999, a piece of
OL,6,     Gmusic started playing in a
OL,7,     Glighthouse in East London. It's
OL,8,     Gcalled Longplayer, and it's set
OL,9,     Gto keep going, without repeating,
OL,10,     Guntil the year 2999.
